out.push(A('⚠ **Two readings of the same weighting, tentative then flat, and the room says which it would argue with.** **It takes a minute a student and it is the most efficient pronunciation work in the unit** — **nobody who has heard the room pounce on _we would probably say_ hedges a weight again.** **Finish on Mrs Khoury\'s sentence, which is the one the cycle is for:** **she had not been outplayed; she had been misdirected by a page I wrote.**'));
