out.push(A('**199 words, the weighting quoted, the threshold read first and said to be, a source named for every criterion, counter-evidence weighed with the closing clause intact, and the surprise last.** ⚠ **The sentence that earns the band is _I wrote a rate and I have been judging a run_** — **it turns a surprise into a fault in his own instrument**, which is 16.5 arriving a cycle early and is exactly what the unit is for.'));
out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — band 2)'));
