out.push(A('⚠ **One criterion, read twice, with the same words in a different order.** **Evidence then verdict, and verdict then evidence.** **Nobody in any room has yet chosen the second**, and the demonstration costs forty seconds a student. **Finish on Mr Barghouti\'s sentence, which is the one the cycle is for:** **one assessment in five is a person whose life was going to be decided by the order in which I happened to read things.**'));
