out.push(A('⚠ **The admission, then the room attaches _although of course_ and a defence of its own invention.** **Everybody hears the word at which the admission stopped being one.** **It takes thirty seconds a student and it is the one piece of pronunciation work in this unit that students quote back a year later.** **Finish on Mr Tahhan\'s sentence:** **the people most likely to have gone and learned something on their own are precisely the ones the line turns away.**'));
