out.push(A('The three moves for each pair. ⚠ **Pair B is the discrimination the cycle is built on and the room will treat it as another missing question.** **A criterion agreed in the room and never published is not a communication gap; it is unfairness**, **and the two need different remedies: a sentence for the first, a reassessment for the second.** **Mark down any pair that offers Pair B a helpful explanation** — **explaining an unpublished criterion to the person it was used against is the most respectable way of defending it.**'));
